I like seeing the, like the, the kind of like bare bones of it, not gameplay wise, but like graphics wise

01:22:53.740 --> 01:22:58.460
and, and the way that they get around those, um, the limitations of the time and everything.

01:22:59.280 --> 01:23:04.840
Uh, so because of that, I mean, I did have a really good time with this game.

01:23:04.920 --> 01:23:06.580
And I think that I would,

01:23:07.680 --> 01:23:15.700
I would say that if you're a person who has just played the first 205 games on the NES,

