I think are going to be more accessible and more enjoyable than this game.

01:23:39.800 --> 01:23:47.180
Like, like I was enjoying this game because I think a lot of it was finally a JRPG on the NES and like,

01:23:47.360 --> 01:23:48.500
oh, I get to see how they did this.

